@startuml
skinparam maxMessageSize 200
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center

actor User
participant "Frontend Client" as Frontend
database "Browser Storage\n(localStorage)" as Storage
participant "FastAPI Backend" as Backend
participant "Groq API" as Groq

== Key Setup (One-time per device/session) ==

User -> Frontend: Inputs Groq API Key\n(Settings Panel)
Frontend -> Storage: Saves API Key locally
Storage --> Frontend: Acknowledges save
Frontend --> User: Displays success message

== Execution Flow ==

User -> Frontend: Submits prompt or triggers action
Frontend -> Storage: Retrieves stored Groq API Key
Storage --> Frontend: Returns API Key
Frontend -> Backend: Sends request\n(Header: X-Groq-Api-Key)

note over Backend
  Intercepts X-Groq-Api-Key header
  Initializes ephemeral AsyncGroq client
  strictly for this execution context
end note

Backend -> Groq: Sends completion request using ephemeral client
Groq --> Backend: Returns generated response

note over Backend
  Returns response to client
  Garbage collects ephemeral client
  (Key is wiped from server memory)
end note

Backend --> Frontend: Returns processed response
Frontend --> User: Displays visualization / result

@enduml